     "text": "Another one who fell out of the sky? ...Oh. You are the one the Captain mentioned. You came through the Colosseum portal. Good. I have a map of what is under this base, and I need someone who can fight.",
     "if": "st_met"
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Lyra",
     "text": "I was a scholar at a library very far from here, until a door opened in the reading room and the floor stopped being the floor. Since then I have been tracing where the rift gets its strength.",
     "if": "st_met"
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Lyra",
     "text": "The old texts I carried out of that library say the worlds were not always many. There was only the Domain, once: one being, one law, one dream. Then it broke. I used to call that a metaphor.",
     "if": "st_met"
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Lyra",
     "text": "It points down. There is a vault below Kestrel, and something called a Shard in it that is pulling doors open across the world. Wherever you are going next, I would like to come with you.",
     "if": "st_met"
    },
    {
     "type": "recruit",
     "name": "Lyra",
     "if": "st_met"
    },
    {
     "type": "flag",
