   "reach": 4.6,
   "actions": [
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Miya",
     "text": "Kenji! Rook said he would bring you, and I did not dare believe it until I saw you standing on that pad."
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Kenji",
     "text": "Miya. Thank the sky. Varro told me you were in the Colosseum infirmary. Rook says you were never there."
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Miya",
     "text": "There was no infirmary. When the Sovereign fell the guards dragged you away and left me in the cave with the water still rising. I thought that was the end of me."
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Miya",
     "text": "Rook's people found me, carried me through one of their doors and put me back together here. I have been asking after you every day."
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Kenji",
     "text": "The Overseer lied to keep me fighting. All of it."
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Miya",
     "text": "Of course he did. Whatever was singing in that water, I felt it too, Kenji, and I do not think it is finished with us. Let me walk with you again."
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Kenji",
     "text": "I would like that. I would rather not walk this road alone."
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "",
     "text": "Miya takes up her staff and falls in beside you once more."
    },
    {
     "type": "flag",
     "key": "st_sera_back"
    },
    {
     "type": "away",
     "name": "Miya",
     "away": false
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "rook_base",
   "name": "Rook",
   "title": "Scout of Outpost Kestrel",
   "sprite": "Rook",
   "x": 3.4,
   "z": 4.4,
   "h": 2.4,
   "showIf": "st_space",
   "reach": 4.6,
   "actions": [
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Rook",
     "text": "Sit, Kenji. Breathe. You have earned the truth, or at least the part of it I own. The Colosseum is not an arena. It is a farm.",
     "unless": "st_rook_told"
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Kenji",
     "text": "A farm.",
     "unless": "st_rook_told"
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Rook",
     "text": "A soul farm, and it reaches across more than one world. The sand, the crowds, the ranks, the collars: all of it exists to ripen fighters. The ones who rise high enough get a releasing ceremony and a long walk down to a door. Nobody walks back up.",
     "unless": "st_rook_told"
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Rook",
     "text": "Had you stuck around, yours would have been claimed next.",
     "unless": "st_rook_told"
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Kenji",
     "text": "Who is behind it?",
     "unless": "st_rook_told"
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Rook",
     "text": "I do not know. Who, or what. My people had been investigating the place for a long time before you showed up. We have bodies and reports and rumours. We do not have a name.",
     "unless": "st_rook_told"
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Kenji",
     "text": "Then why free me? Why me, of all the prisoners in that Pit?",
     "unless": "st_rook_told"
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Rook",
     "text": "Because nobody had ever done what you did. In all the years I watched, not one fighter climbed past Rank 2. You were the first.",
     "unless": "st_rook_told"
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Rook",
     "text": "I think that makes you important to whatever the owners of that place are planning. Maybe the key to it. So I pulled you out. Whatever they wanted you for, they do not get it. Call it a wrench in the works.",
     "unless": "st_rook_told"
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Miya",
     "text": "That is a great deal to take in.",
     "unless": "st_rook_told"
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Rook",
     "text": "It is. And it is not finished. We are not in the same world any more, Kenji. The universe is made of many dimensions, and each of them holds many worlds. Your island was one. The Colosseum was another. This rock is a third.",
     "unless": "st_rook_told"
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Kenji",
     "text": "I have a hundred questions.",
     "unless": "st_rook_told"
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Rook",
     "text": "Then come and get your answers. There is a Vault under this base. It holds most of them, maybe all. Speak to Captain Rhea, find Lyra, she has the map, and meet me at the hatch west of the landing pad.",
     "unless": "st_rook_told"
    },
    {
     "type": "flag",
     "key": "st_rook_told",
     "unless": "st_rook_told"
    },
    {
     "type": "say",
     "who": "Rook",
     "text": "Captain Rhea first, then Lyra, then the hatch west of the pad. I will be waiting. And rest if you need it. The Vault is not a place to walk into tired.",
     "if": "st_rook_told"
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
